#. Tag: title
#: apiGraphstructure.docbook:2
#, no-c-format
msgid "Scripting API for Graph Backend"
msgstr "Skiptiranje API-ja za podršku grafovima"

#. Tag: para
#: apiGraphstructure.docbook:4
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"The data structure properties dialog allows access to configure settings "
"specific to the Graph backend. There, with <guilabel>Graph Type</guilabel> "
"you can select the type of the graph. The meaning of these types is as "
"follows:"
msgstr ""
"Dijalog sa opcijama za ststrukture podataka dozvoljava konigursanje posavki "
"specifičnih za podršku gafovima. Tako da sa <guilabel>Tip grafa</guilabel> "
"možete izabrati tip grafa. Značenje ovih tipova je:"

#. Tag: para
#: apiGraphstructure.docbook:9
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"<guilabel>Graph</guilabel>: Graph at which same edges (with respect to start "
"and end points) may not exist multiple times."
msgstr ""
"<guilabel>Graf</guilabel>: Graf kod kojeg neke ivice(sa uvažavanjem početnih "
"i krajnjih) možda ne postoje više puta."

#. Tag: para
#: apiGraphstructure.docbook:12
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"<guilabel>Multigraph</guilabel>: Graph at which same edges (with respect to "
"start and end points) may exist multiple times."
msgstr ""
"<guilabel>Multigraf</guilabel>: Graf kod kojeg neke ivice(sa uvažavanjem "
"početnih i krajnjih) možda postoje više puta."

#. Tag: title
#: apiGraphstructure.docbook:18
#, no-c-format
msgid "Graph Data Structure"
msgstr "Grafička struktura podataka"

#. Tag: para
#: apiGraphstructure.docbook:19
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"A graph objects holds the information of a data structure of type "
"<quote>Graph</quote>."
msgstr ""
"Grafički objeti čuvaju informaciju i strukturi podataka tipa <quote>Graf</"
"quote>."

#. Tag: title
#: apiGraphstructure.docbook:24 apiGraphstructure.docbook:163
#: apiGraphstructure.docbook:314
#, no-c-format
msgid "Properties"
msgstr "Osobine"

#. Tag: para
#: apiGraphstructure.docbook:28
#, no-c-format
msgid "<emphasis>name</emphasis> :"
msgstr "<emphasis>ime</emphasis> :"

#. Tag: para
#: apiGraphstructure.docbook:31
#, no-c-format
msgid "The unique name of this data structure."
msgstr "Jedinstveno ime ove strukture podataka."

