#, no-c-format
msgid "nodes()"
msgstr "nodes()"

#. Tag: para
#: apiGraphstructure.docbook:44
#, no-c-format
msgid "Return list all nodes in the graph."
msgstr "Vrati listu svih čvorova u grafu."

